": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27954057797592798"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "994646723277799"}]}, "change_log": "Fixed a crash when closing the app while a video was playing.\r\nFixed a crash when searching or filtering Movies and Series on very large playlists.\r\nFixed a video engine issue that could freeze playback after 10 to 20 minutes of continuous viewing.\r\nLive channels start faster, switching is quicker, and a stalled stream recovers on its own.\r\nFixed a rare crash when switching channels. Playback no longer stops over a single decode glitch.\r\nThe progress bar slides smoothly, with a time bubble while you scrub.\r\nChannel logos fall back to our own logo service when your provider's are missing.\r\nHome loads faster, with Continue Watching first.\r\nA title removed from Continue Watching on one device no longer comes back from another.", "created_date": 1788499472, "id": "27954057797592798", "version": "3.2.2", "version_code": 4050, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26465441283121131", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27954057797592798"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "994646723277799"}]}, "change_log": "Added Stream VPN: route a playlist's streams through your own VPN (Proton VPN, Windscribe, Mullvad, or WireGuard).\r\nAdded team and player pages in Sports, plus Favorite Teams with their own rail.\r\nImproved channel switching: the old channel disconnects first, fixing buffering on single-connection playlists.\r\nImproved Home: the most important rows come first, and Continue Watching appears instantly.", "created_date": 1788153890, "id": "27899636533034925", "version": "3.2.0", "version_code": 4048, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26465441283121131", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27954057797592798"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "994646723277799"}]}, "change_log": "New\r\n- The home sports rail is now Top 10 Sports Events, ranked for the day.\r\n- Home rails show one card per title instead of one per language or quality.\r\n\r\nImproved\r\n- The home banner cross-dissolves between titles and no longer stutters when it loops.\r\n- The Guide opens on the category your provider lists first, and remembers the one you used last.\r\n- Channel previews in the Guide fade in instead of flashing black.\r\n- Top TV Channels shows proper channel logos.\r\n- Episode names and descriptions follow the app language.\r\n- Darker theme: black content area with a lighter sidebar.\r\n\r\nFixed\r\n- Continue Watching no longer shows a barely-watched title as finished.\r\n- Fixed a crash in Sports Hub when the posts carousel appeared.", "created_date": 1787618659, "id": "27821341417531104", "version": "3.1.29", "version_code": 4045, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26465441283121131", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27954057797592798"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "994646723277799"}]}, "change_log": "Fixed the app closing during playback on large playlists.\r\nFixed resuming a series from Continue Watching, which showed the episode as unavailable instead of playing it.\r\nFixed searching the Guide on large playlists.\r\nFixed the keyboard reopening by itself after resizing the app panel.\r\nContinue Watching and Top TV Channels now load faster.", "created_date": 1787173121, "id": "27759388910393022", "version": "3.1.28", "version_code": 4044, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "26465441283121131", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "27954057797592798"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "994646723277799"}]}, "change_log": "- Series specials now appear. A show's one-offs and extras show as a \"Specials\" block after the regular seasons, with their own titles, art and synopses.\r\n- One card per episode. Episodes a provider lists more than once no longer appear as duplicates, and series that already piled up duplicates clean themselves up.\r\n- Clearer version picking. Versions with no playable file for the episode you chose are labeled \"Not available\", and picking a version never switches you to a different episode.\r\n- Better playback errors. When a file is broken at the provider the player says so instead of blaming a connection limit, and offers \"Try Another Version\" right in the player, now for series as well as movies.\r\n- Subtitle downloads work again when signed out, and each download tells you how many you have left today.\r\n- Continue Watching rows synced from another device no longer grey out as unavailable.", "created_date": 1787101049, "id": "27748942178104362", "version": "3.1.27", "version_code": 4041, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}